<title>UK: LME zinc touches fresh high, nickel dips.</title>
<headline>LME zinc touches fresh high, nickel dips.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Breaches $1,380, hits 4-3/4 year high.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Dips below $7,200 after stocks rise by 1,128 tonnes.</p>
<p>COPPER - Touch lower after stocks rise by 825 tonnes.</p>
<p>Cash/threes backwardation little changed at $103/$108.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Barely changed, hovering under $1,600, after</p>
<p>stocks fall 3,875 tonnes. LEAD/TIN - Little changed</p>
</text>
